# The face (release and debug builds): only source/, the shared folders it uses and resources/ (the default would take
# every folder, the debug case loader and its generated files too). The case loader is cases.jungle (README.md).
# Shared code it doesn't name never lands in its build (128 KB, #217): apps/garmin/README.md › Shared.
project.manifest = manifest.xml
project.typecheck = 1
base.sourcePath = source;../shared/link
base.resourcePath = resources
base.lang.spa = resources-spa
base.excludeAnnotations = app;field
